{"data":"<div class=\"rounded bg-white h-100\">\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"px-3 pt-3\">\n            <div id=\"player\" class=\"d-none\"><\/div>\n            <div class=\"dur\"><\/div>\n            <h1 class=\"m-0 font-weight-600\">[U6-P5]\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8<\/h1>\n                            <i class=\"fa-regular fa-circle-check text-success\"><\/i>\n                <span class=\"pl-1 text-success\">Completed<\/span>\n                    <\/div>\n        <div class=\"px-3 pt-3\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-gray-f3 p-1 rounded mb-2\">\r\n            <div class=\"row py-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <span class=\"mr-2 font-weight-bold\">\r\n                    Deadline:\r\n                <\/span>\r\n                <span id=\"activity-has-deadline\" class=\"\">\r\n                                            26\/03\/2026 23:59:00\r\n                                    <\/span>\r\n                <span id=\"activity-does-not-have-deadline\" class=\" d-none \">\r\n                    Not set\r\n                <\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    \r\n            <div class=\"row py-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <span class=\"mr-2 font-weight-bold\">\r\n                    Passing grade:\r\n                <\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"text-success\">\r\n                    0\r\n                <\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    \r\n            <div class=\"row py-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\r\n                <span class=\"mr-2 font-weight-bold\">\r\n                    Max grade:\r\n                <\/span>\r\n                <span class=\"text-info\">\r\n                    10\r\n                <\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    \r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"w-100 custom-vh-50 border-file-read rounded d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n    <div class=\"text-window overflow-auto p-2 thin-scrollbar-thumb-route-gray thin-scrollbar-lg w-100 h-100 text-gray-reader ck-content\">\r\n        <p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>1. M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">Sinh vi\u00ean c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 truy\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea1t n\u1ed9i dung m\u00e0 b\u1ea3n th\u00e2n mu\u1ed1n truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c th\u00f4ng qua vi\u1ec7c vi\u1ebft b\u00e0i lu\u1eadn.<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">M\u1ed7i b\u00e0i lu\u1eadn ch\u1ee9a \u0111\u1ef1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u00e9t \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o trong c\u00e1 t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea3n th\u00e2n sinh vi\u00ean.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>2. Quy \u0111\u1ecbnh:<\/strong><\/span><\/h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>S\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u00e2u t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u:<\/strong> M\u1ed7i b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea1t \u00edt nh\u1ea5t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u00e2u m\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec1 b\u00e0i y\u00eau c\u1ea7u.&nbsp;<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>C\u00e1ch di\u1ec5n \u0111\u1ea1t n\u1ed9i dung:&nbsp;<\/strong>N\u1ed9i dung b\u00e0i essay ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c di\u1ec5n \u0111\u1ea1t m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, d\u1ec5 hi\u1ec3u v\u1edbi tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a b\u1ea3n th\u00e2n. Kh\u00f4ng d\u00f9ng tool \u0111\u1ec3 vi\u1ebft nh\u1eefng c\u00e2u t\u1eeb m\u00e0 ch\u00ednh b\u1ea3n th\u00e2n kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ecdc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c\/kh\u00f4ng hi\u1ec3u ngh\u0129a.<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>D\u1ee5ng c\u1ee5:<\/strong> M\u1ed7i sinh vi\u00ean ph\u1ea3i c\u00f3 s\u1ed5 Essay ri\u00eang, kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft tr\u00ean t\u1edd gi\u1ea5y r\u1eddi (gi\u1ea5y A4, gi\u1ea5y x\u00e9 t\u1eeb s\u1ed5\/v\u1edf).&nbsp;<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>Ch\u1eef vi\u1ebft:<\/strong> Ch\u1ec9nh chu, d\u1ec5 \u0111\u1ecdc (kh\u00f4ng vi\u1ebft c\u1ea9u th\u1ea3, qua loa l\u1ea5y l\u1ec7, kh\u00f4ng b\u00f4i x\u00f3a qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u\u2026)<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>B\u00e0i n\u1ed9p:<\/strong> Sinh vi\u00ean sau khi vi\u1ebft xong n\u1ed9p 2 b\u1ea3n bao g\u1ed3m b\u1ea3n vi\u1ebft tay v\u00e0 b\u1ea3n .doc l\u00ean h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean ch\u1ea5m \u0111i\u1ec3m.&nbsp;<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>3. H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u00e1ch vi\u1ebft hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3:<\/strong><\/span><\/p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>T\u01b0 duy b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt:<\/strong> Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u vi\u1ebft, h\u00e3y d\u00e0nh th\u1eddi gian suy ngh\u0129 v\u1ec1 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt. V\u1ebd s\u01a1 \u0111\u1ed3 t\u01b0 duy v\u00e0 ghi ch\u00fa l\u1ea1i c\u00e1c t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng, c\u1ee5m t\u1eeb v\u00e0 \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng ch\u00ednh tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt.<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>Ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng:<\/strong> Sau khi suy ngh\u0129 v\u1ec1 c\u00e1c \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, sinh vi\u00ean n\u00ean m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng ch\u00fang th\u00e0nh c\u00e1c c\u00e2u ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh. C\u1ed1 g\u1eafng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nhi\u1ec1u lo\u1ea1i c\u00e2u (ng\u1eafn, d\u00e0i, ph\u1ee9c h\u1ee3p) v\u00e0 c\u00e1c c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ecdc.<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>Ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i nh\u1eadn x\u00e9t:<\/strong> Sau khi n\u1ed9p b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft, sinh vi\u00ean n\u00ean xem l\u1ea1i ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i c\u1ee7a gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean v\u00e0 s\u1eeda l\u1ea1i b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean nh\u1eefng g\u00f3p \u00fd \u0111\u00f3.<i>&nbsp;<strong><u>Sinh vi\u00ean c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i l\u1ea1i g\u00f3p \u00fd c\u1ee7a gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean n\u1ebfu c\u00f3.<\/u><\/strong><\/i><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><strong>4. \u0110\u1ec1 b\u00e0i:<\/strong><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">D\u1ef1a tr\u00ean mindmap gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean cung c\u1ea5p, h\u00e3y vi\u1ebft b\u00e0i v\u0103n <strong>t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 8 c\u00e2u<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 k\u1ec3 v\u1ec1 1 ng\u00e0y \u0111i ch\u01a1i c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 ho\u1eb7c gia \u0111\u00ecnh.<\/span><\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n                    <\/div>\n\n        <div class=\"px-3 pt-3\">\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div class=\"w-100 px-3 pt-3\">\n                <div id=\"file-feedback\" class=\"border-bottom\">\n    <div>\n        <span class=\"font-weight-bold\"> Feedback files <\/span>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap mb-1\">\n                    <div class=\"pt-2 text-info\">\n                No feedbacks\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n<\/div>                <div id=\"upload-new-files\" class=\"row mt-2 \">\r\n            <div class=\"col-xl-6 d-flex-not-important align-items-center\">\r\n                <div id=\"audio\">\r\n    <div class=\"mb-2 d-flex-not-important align-items-center\">\r\n        <span class=\"mr-2 text-dark\">Select audio input<\/span>\r\n        <select class=\"rounded\" name=\"\" id=\"micSelect\"><\/select>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <select id=\"visSelect\" class=\"d-none\">\r\n        <option value=\"frequencybars\">Bar<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"sinewave\" selected>Wave<\/option>\r\n        <option value=\"circle\">Circle<\/option>\r\n    <\/select>\r\n    <div class=\"audio-controls d-flex-not-important align-items-center\">\r\n        <button id=\"record\" class=\"text-dark btn bg-transparent\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"fa